{"id":"MOEX-112100-2301-Q064","title":"Tolvaptan：口服V2拮抗與自由水排出","version":"integration-v2 after accepted tone/teaching patches","batch":"112-2-med2-q51-100","sourceSha256":"c5de8c0e3af4773e0acd1361654bb14a217102f090c6e3e4dddfcffab1615597","shortHtml":"<p><strong>選D，tolvaptan。</strong>Vasopressin也稱<strong>抗利尿激素（antidiuretic hormone，ADH）</strong>。Tolvaptan是<strong>口服、以V2受體為主要標的的拮抗劑</strong>。Conivaptan同樣具有vasopressin拮抗作用；兩者在本題的決勝差別是<strong>給藥途徑</strong>。</p>","html":"<h2>Tolvaptan：口服V2拮抗與自由水排出</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：D</p><h3>同為vasopressin拮抗劑，還要比較給藥途徑</h3>\n<p><strong>選D，tolvaptan。</strong>Vasopressin也稱<strong>抗利尿激素（antidiuretic hormone，ADH）</strong>。Tolvaptan是<strong>口服、以V2受體為主要標的的拮抗劑</strong>。Conivaptan同樣具有vasopressin拮抗作用；兩者在本題的決勝差別是<strong>給藥途徑</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>藥物</th><th>本題要區別的作用點／劑型</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Conivaptan</td><td><strong>V1A與V2受體拮抗</strong>；Vaprisol為靜脈用藥。</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Metolazone</td><td>Thiazide-like（類噻嗪）利尿劑，主要抑制腎小管鈉再吸收。</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Triamterene</td><td>作用於遠端腎元鈉再吸收的<strong>保鉀利尿劑</strong>。</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Tolvaptan</strong></td><td><strong>選擇性V2受體拮抗、口服。</strong>兩個條件都符合。</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>阻斷ADH，如何使尿中水分增加？</h3>\n<p>正常情況下，集合管V2受體活化會使細胞內<strong>環腺苷單磷酸（cyclic adenosine monophosphate，cAMP）</strong>增加，促進含<strong>水通道蛋白2（aquaporin-2，AQP2）</strong>的囊泡與細胞膜融合，提高水的通透性。Tolvaptan阻斷這條訊號，減少AQP2的膜上作用，使水再吸收下降。</p>\n<figure>\n<span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1772px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.5612334801762116\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/ca2aaecb142030efac27119e8fc329d474195e58ed9280257b36a468d8b86dee.png\" alt=\"集合管主細胞的V2受體、cAMP與PKA訊號使AQP2囊泡移向右側頂端膜，水再由左側AQP3與AQP4離開細胞\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1772\" height=\"1135\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/ca2aaecb142030efac27119e8fc329d474195e58ed9280257b36a468d8b86dee.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a>\n<figcaption><p><strong>沿訊號與水流各讀一條路徑。</strong>左側基底外側膜的V2受體接受AVP（精胺酸加壓素）訊號，經AC（腺苷酸環化酶）、cAMP與PKA（蛋白激酶A），促使AQP2囊泡移向右側頂端膜。藍色水流箭頭由右側管腔經AQP2入細胞，再由左側AQP3／4流出。Tolvaptan的受體阻斷點可對照左側V2，連回正文的自由水排出機轉。</p><p>原圖：Vukicevic、Schulz、Faust與Klussmann，2016，Figure 1；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 4.0</a>。</p></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p>其結果稱為<strong>自由水排出增加（aquaresis）</strong>：尿量增加、尿滲透壓下降。相較於主要抑制鈉再吸收的利尿藥，V2拮抗劑的作用重點是<strong>降低集合管對水的再吸收</strong>。</p>\n<h3>由排水機轉連到製劑用途與安全監測</h3>\n<p>Tolvaptan不同製劑及用途的適應症、療程與監測要求並不相同。與排水作用相連的<strong>口渴、多尿、脫水及高血鈉</strong>，以及特定長期用途中重要的肝損傷警訊，都與治療選擇及監測有關。本題的選擇依據仍是<strong>口服V2拮抗劑</strong>這一組藥理特徵。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與圖文查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部正式原題（卷碼2301）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本科最後更正：Q69最終一律給分；其餘依更正答鍵</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=e507a317-0acc-4415-f6ec-3ec757565f31\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DailyMed tolvaptan正式標籤：藥理、劑型與重要安全資料</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=efa8795e-2c89-4519-b49f-13146fb9ded1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DailyMed metolazone正式標籤：藥理、劑型與重要安全資料</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=e92f1118-8eaf-4fa8-b167-1447550af1ab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DailyMed triamterene正式標籤：藥理、劑型與重要安全資料</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2012/021697s003lbl.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Vaprisol 2012正式仿單：V1A/V2及僅靜脈給藥</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/pharmacology/articles/10.3389/fphar.2016.00023/full\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vukicevic等2016 Figure 1：V2–AQP2膜轉位與跨細胞水流；CC BY 4.0</a></li></ul></details>","imageCount":1,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：D"}